    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mr.Welder\u2019s Pinball Defence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tells the story of Mr. Welder, a hard-working farmer who loves pinball. When the alien invasion began, he knew exactly what to do\u2014he built his pinball defense to protect his farm and humanity from the invaders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/32d13703cf412d4e0af5877d75047866.poster.avif?t=1748289705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/32d13703cf412d4e0af5877d75047866.webm?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/32d13703cf412d4e0af5877d75047866.mp4?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/ec62480954440e74c12809d0854e6d66.poster.avif?t=1748289705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/ec62480954440e74c12809d0854e6d66.webm?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/ec62480954440e74c12809d0854e6d66.mp4?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/6f8b2e84699864402b56700d1bcb5f8f.poster.avif?t=1748289705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/6f8b2e84699864402b56700d1bcb5f8f.webm?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/6f8b2e84699864402b56700d1bcb5f8f.mp4?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/c1c9f8dfdf15e5ed828c4fb80f959c5b.poster.avif?t=1748289705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/c1c9f8dfdf15e5ed828c4fb80f959c5b.webm?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/c1c9f8dfdf15e5ed828c4fb80f959c5b.mp4?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/be78c1c7ed3e0153386a5b93e04a1b91.poster.avif?t=1748289705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/be78c1c7ed3e0153386a5b93e04a1b91.webm?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/be78c1c7ed3e0153386a5b93e04a1b91.mp4?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/b607585abcd324b1dc6e9318ac119380.poster.avif?t=1748289705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/b607585abcd324b1dc6e9318ac119380.webm?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/b607585abcd324b1dc6e9318ac119380.mp4?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > To activate a trap, you need to hit it with the ball. Additionally, you can directly damage aliens using the ball. The more traps you hit in a row, the hotter the ball becomes, inflicting greater damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/3bb2a08b9322ce4cfb37c6377b9fbb27.poster.avif?t=1748289705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/3bb2a08b9322ce4cfb37c6377b9fbb27.webm?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/3bb2a08b9322ce4cfb37c6377b9fbb27.mp4?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> With the action pause feature, you can construct and maintain trap towers anywhere within the improvised pinball field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/4ba3492be9334d93ce68ed7c08a9ac8c.poster.avif?t=1748289705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/4ba3492be9334d93ce68ed7c08a9ac8c.webm?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/4ba3492be9334d93ce68ed7c08a9ac8c.mp4?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each level features a central mechanism that you can activate and control to unleash special effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/139d4bfaf375f36e5803886a1dc188d4.poster.avif?t=1748289705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/139d4bfaf375f36e5803886a1dc188d4.webm?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/139d4bfaf375f36e5803886a1dc188d4.mp4?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> The primary objective of the game is to destroy the mothership flying saucer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/b575fc41eb36397929ba613fc9e98973.poster.avif?t=1748289705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/b575fc41eb36397929ba613fc9e98973.webm?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255600/extras/b575fc41eb36397929ba613fc9e98973.mp4?t=1748289705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Get ready to confront a serpentine and perilous enemy.</p>",
